# Input

```svelte
<script>export let count=0; $: doubled=count*2;</script>
<button on:click = {() => count++}>{doubled}</button>
<slot name = "label" />

```


# Formatted

```svelte
<script>
export let count = 0;
$: doubled = count * 2;
</script>
<button on:click={() => count++}>{doubled}</button>
<slot name="label" />

```
